    "title": "【2026Hackathon决赛】34：视频编码前处理增强：基于人眼感知提升压缩率",
    "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 13pt; text-indent: 24.8pt; overflow-x: auto; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">视频编码前处理增强：基于人眼感知提升压缩率</span></h2>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">决赛赛题来自技术领域：媒体图像处理。</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">赛题限制：本赛题开发验证与结果验收均在<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Windows11</span>（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">X64</span>）环境，建议开发者使用<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Windows11</span>参赛；对网络环境无限制。</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 13.0pt; margin-bottom: 13.0pt; cm;mso-para-gd; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; overflow-x: auto;\"><span><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 172%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\">二、背景信息（赛题产生的业务背景）：</span></u></span><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 172%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></u></h2>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 18.6pt; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">随着短视频、直播、云游戏、超高清视频和实时通信等业务快速发展，服务器端视频转码的计算量和资源消耗都在持续增加。视频编码效率直接影响<b>带宽成本、存储成本和用户体验</b>。如何在产业成熟编码生态（<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">H.265/HEVC</span>）基础上，进一步提升转码效率（相同带宽下提升感知画质或同感知质量减少编码码率）成为新的挑战。<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 18.6pt; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">视频前处理</span></b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">是一种无需修改编码器结构的优化手段，通过在编码前对视频进行图像去噪、纹理调整、边缘增强与亮度映射等处理，减少无效信息、改善人眼视觉主观感知质量，提升编码的压缩效率。<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 18.6pt; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">本赛题的核心问题：<b>不修改编码器前提下对视频进行<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">“</span>编码友好<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">”</span>的智能处理，让视频更容易被压缩，提升人眼感知质量。</b></span><span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 18.6pt; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">参赛者需设计创新的视频前处理算法，在<b>不修改指定编码器内部配置</b>的前提下，通过对原始视频序列进行处理，使编码后的视觉感知质量（<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">VMAF BD-Rate</span>）更高，同时控制像素保真度（<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">PSNR BD-Rate</span>）损失，并兼顾计算效率与内容泛化能力等。</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 18.6pt; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">核心目标：让视频“更好看、更好压、更高效”</span></b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">。</span><span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 13.0pt; margin-bottom: 13.0pt; cm;mso-para-gd; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; overflow-x: auto;\"><span><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 172%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\">三、问题描述（现状、技术挑战等）：</span></u></span><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 172%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></u></h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">1. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">常规编码方案：<span></span></span></b></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 18.6pt; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">视频常规压缩方案基于像素域保真度指标优化率失真性能，主要通过预测、变换、量化和熵编码等技术方案降低视频码率。<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">编码器内部的关键技术：<span></span></span></b></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings;\"><span>ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">RDO</span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">（<span>Rate Distortion Optimization</span>）<span>;</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings;\"><span>ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">SAO</span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">；<span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings;\"><span>ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">Deblocking</span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">；<span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings;\"><span>ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">Adaptive Quantization</span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">；<span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings;\"><span>ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">PSY-RD</span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">。<span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">优化目标：<span></span></span></b></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">率失真优化公式 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif;\"> <img src=\"https://www.chaspark.com/chasiwu/media/v1/tinyimage/1326727227078836224.jpeg?state=2&auth_key=1791450140-sw797y8uanypt5po4a6lkpatmhn7gckd-0-51643c2d015f825d116fa90c081eb565ee3b2f7e4deb1b1bb373d3e1d6a67c1e\" style=\"; vertical-align: middle;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">，即在有限码率约束下，使重建视频失真（<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">D</span>）最小；或在满足质量要求下，使码率最低。该公式为视频编码大量决策过程中的理论基础。</span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">其中<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">D</span>为像素误差<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">MSE</span>（原始值与预测值之差），</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif;\"> <img src=\"https://www.chaspark.com/chasiwu/media/v1/tinyimage/1326727227800276992.jpeg?state=2&auth_key=1791450140-1vaxzvkfdselgmwwnyk7gnmpsp1dup2l-0-cdb16db9b731ff53ea8327eb6e358fe96cbe2e8fc407df1be1e98e833a8ec334\" style=\"; vertical-align: middle;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">，<span style=\"color: #252b3a; background: white;\">由于<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">MSE</span>等像素域指标与人眼感知存在差异，单纯依赖像素误差优化可能导致编码效率与主观质量不匹配，因此，需结合人视觉感知特性设计优化方案</span>。<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">例如：<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">a</span>）平坦区域<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"> <img src=\"https://www.chaspark.com/chasiwu/media/v1/tinyimage/1326727228215513088.jpeg?state=2&auth_key=1791450140-hcx6xf2p9uvx7ahnem40c7sa1ejpeann-0-de69a5b67bc5ec2ea3a7bd20e0f331b14bd1bfcc348f3c3350460d47d4afc7a5\"> </span>；<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">b</span>）复杂纹理区域<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"> <img src=\"https://www.chaspark.com/chasiwu/media/v1/tinyimage/1326727229293449216.jpeg?state=2&auth_key=1791450140-jtj6osehssrp6we5aiy9lffjyzxk1i10-0-c4b59cec4ef3f866818f39ec7b44983d20e4120bb4a084cdb7b7d0c5f93c14b6\"> </span>产生同样数量的像素误差，<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">MSE</span>虽然一致，但人眼感知不一样（即平坦区域可明显感知，复杂纹理区域感知不明显）。<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">2. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">视觉感知前处理算法：<span></span></span></b></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">HVS</span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">（<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">Human Visual System</span>，人类视觉感知系统）对不同视频画面的区域失真的敏感度不同，<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">HVS</span>具有如下特点：<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">对高频不敏感<span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">对边缘敏感<span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">对局部对比度敏感<span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">优化的目标方向：<span></span></span></b></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">对视频进行前处理，可以去除视频信号冗余，但也不能简单降噪，否则<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">PSNR</span>会明显下降，故要寻找视觉损失小<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">+</span>编码收益间的平衡方案。<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> <img src=\"https://www.chaspark.com/chasiwu/media/v1/tinyimage/1326727230342025216.jpeg?state=2&auth_key=1791450141-bqxgouhazhxw12nev8s7wz1lyhpikkr0-0-dd74f7e13625035b2de0b7fcc34ac1c6efc8a307460f1bebccb657cee97b0a4b\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">3. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">技术挑战点：<span></span></span></b></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">感知质量与像素保真度的权衡<span></span></span></b></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 21.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">相同码率下提升感知质量（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">VMAF BD-Rate</span>）的同时，需将像素保真度（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">PSNR BD-Rate</span>）损失控制在合理范围内。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">前处理与编码器特性的非线性耦合</span></b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 21.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">前处理会改变视频纹理、结构与时空特征，其最终收益与编码器的预测、变换、量化等过程相关，难以通过单一规则准确建模。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">多目标协同优化</span></b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">需权衡<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">VMAF</span>、<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">PNSR</span>、码率和编码速度等指标，避免单一指标优化导致整体收益下降。<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">内容自适应与泛化能力</span></b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 21.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">不同视频内容在纹理、运动与噪声等特征上存在差异，前处理算法需具备内容自适应能力，并在不同视频场景下保持稳定收益。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">4. </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">视频感知前处理探索方向：</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">本次挑战赛核心目的：设计图像前处理方案，提升视频编码效率。可以探索方向如下（鼓励新方案，不限制新方向的探索）：<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">编码友好的图像降噪：</span></b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">降低编码器难以预测的随机信息（如<span>Temporal/Spatial Denoise</span>、<span>Bilateral Filter</span>）<span></span></span></li>\n<li><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">视觉感知的纹理优化：</span></b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">利用人眼视觉掩蔽效应，优化人眼不敏感编码代价高的纹理区域，对视觉重要区域进行保护（如<span>Texture Analysis</span>、<span> Contrast Optimization</span>、<span>Frequency-domain Filtering</span>）<span></span></span></li>\n<li><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">视觉信号域（亮度与色度）分<span style=\"color: black;\">布优化：</span></span></b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black;\">亮度分布特性、边缘、纹理、主体细节，</span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">亮度重映射调整亮度分布，使其更符合编码器的预测特性</span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">（如<span>Luma Mapping</span>、<span>Adaptive tone Mapping</span>、<span>Luma Quantization Optimization</span>、<span>Chroma Denoise</span>）<span></span></span></li>\n<li><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">图像细节重构与压缩优化增强：</span></b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">让图像更容易被预测，提升编码效率（如<span>Edge-aware smoothing</span>、<span>Structure Enhancement</span>）<span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">参赛者选取上述一种或多种方向进行图像的前处理优化，也可以探索新的方向达成优化目的。</span><span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">5. </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">赛题任务：</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">完成前处理模块算法设计与实现，视频序列、视频编码器与编码参数及质量评测流程出题方均会提供评测方法。</span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; background: white;\">参赛者需根据探索方向中的技术（如降噪、纹理优化等）设计具体实现方案，并验证其对编码效率的提升效果。<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">接口定义：</span></b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">本赛题对视频序列帧进行前处理，参赛者聚焦帧的增强处理算法即可（帧数据读取<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">/</span>写入等逻辑出题方提供，参赛者完成<b><span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">8bit</span></b>的视频序列前处理）。<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"mso-para-gd; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: black; background: white;\">void processYUVFrame(const uint8_t* src, uint8_t* dst, int width, int height, int crf)</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 13.0pt; margin-bottom: 13.0pt; cm;mso-para-gd; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; overflow-x: auto;\"><span><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 172%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\">四、期望达到的指标和效果（含性能<span style=\"line-height: 172%;\">/</span>精度等指标）：</span></u></span><span><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 172%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></u></span></h2>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">功能目标：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">本赛题为图像前处理优化，处理后要保证内容的语义与初始的一致性。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">禁止对输入序列进行超分、插帧、降分辨率、变动<span>FPS</span>等<span></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">允许对图像进行去噪、平滑、纹理调整、颜色增强优化等<span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">性能目标：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">在满足<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">PSNR</span>损失约束的前提下，<b>最大化<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">VMAF</span>增益或码率节省</b>，且算法具备良好的内容泛化能力和时域稳定性</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">。</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">视频编码常用指标：<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">VMAF</span>、<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">PSNR</span>、编码速度，三个指标均与基线版本三个指标计算变化量。对<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">3</span>个指标进行综合评价作为参赛者的最终成绩（三个指标权重依次为：<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">VMAF&gt;PSNR&gt;</span>编码速度），切莫追求单一指标，造成另外两个指标影响较大。<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-indent: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 5.0pt; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black;\">PSNR</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black;\">损失满足约束下，<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">VMAF</span>提升幅度（越高越好）；</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-indent: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 5.0pt; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black;\">PSNR</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black;\">损失控制（<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">PSNR BD-Rate</span>损失<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"> ≤ 0.3</span>）；</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-indent: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 5.0pt; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black;\">相同<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">VMAF</span>质量下的码率节省；</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-indent: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 5.0pt; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black;\">计算复杂度与处理时间限制。</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">开发语言<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&amp;</span>环境：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 18.6pt; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">开发语言：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">C/C++</span>；运行平台：</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">Windows 11</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">X64</span>）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">，<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Intel CPU </span>主频<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">2~4GHz</span>即可（不严格要求）</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">。</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 13.0pt; margin-bottom: 13.0pt; cm;mso-para-gd; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; overflow-x: auto;\"><span><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 172%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\">五、测试用例</span></u></span><span><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 172%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></u></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 120%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">视频帧前处理指标评测用例执行流程如下（测试序列、测试框架代码、执行脚本、编码工具、指标计算工具等开赛前发布）。<span style=\"line-height: 120%;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> <img src=\"https://www.chaspark.com/chasiwu/media/v1/tinyimage/1326727231612211200.jpeg?state=2&auth_key=1791450141-j3lcrlleswxjgffhyceodcicemxz4mdj-0-2c1b148c76540a18fca120faf530d9800f81a1f95ab1fd2833ec182daf45bfba&translate_time=1791450149\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 13.0pt; margin-bottom: 13.0pt; cm;mso-para-gd; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; overflow-x: auto;\"><span><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 172%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\">六、参考文献（可选，如有请提供）：<span style=\"line-height: 172%;\"></span></span></u></span></h2>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">NA</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 13.0pt; margin-bottom: 13.0pt; cm;mso-para-gd; mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; overflow-x: auto;\"><span><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 172%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\">七、评选标准（如评分维度，分成几档等）：</span></u></span><span><u><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 172%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></u></span></h2>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 110%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><a style=\"color: unset; text-decoration: unset; border-bottom: unset;\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">赛题验收会使用多条视频序列</span></span></a><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">，每条序列会执行两遍测试用例流程，所得的结果作为主要的质量与性能对比项：</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-indent: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">基线版本：在默认环境下，未进行编码前处理，执行测试用例执行，得到每条序列的<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">PSNR</span>、<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">VMAF</span>、帧编码耗时数据。</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-indent: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">前处理优化版本：在同基线版本验证环境下，先对每条序列进行前处理，再执行编码操作，得到每条序列的<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">PSNR</span>、<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">VMAF</span>、帧编码耗时（含帧前处理耗时）；再与基线版本计算每条序列的<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">VMAF BD-Rate</span>、<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">PSNR BD-Rate</span>、帧编码耗时指标变化（多条序列取各指标均值）。</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 110%; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">1</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">、评价维度：</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 110%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">a</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">）基础项：经前处理与编码后生成的序列与原始序列主观对比画质正常，无明显异常，此项有异常表示前处理优化挑战失败。</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 18.6pt; line-height: 110%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">b</span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">）<b><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">VMAF BD-Rate</span>指标：</b>对比基线提升越高越优，优化<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">1%</span>，得<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">20</span>分，优化<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">2%</span>，得<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">40</span>分，依次累计。<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 18.6pt; line-height: 110%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">c</span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">）<b><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">PSNR BD-Rate</span>指标：</b>指标损失<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"> ≤ 0.3</span>不扣分，损失每超<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">0.1%</span>，扣<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">5</span>分，同样指标优化<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">0.1%</span>，多得<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">5</span>分，累计计算该项分数。</span><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 110%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">d</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">）帧编码耗时指标：影响越小越优，如编码耗时<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">&lt;3%</span>不扣分，每超过<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">1%</span>，多扣<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">5</span>分。</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 110%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">2</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">、其他加分项：提出算法具备独立的创新性，能提供详细的算法说明文档、复杂度分析文档等，根据文档或方案质量加分<span style=\"line-height: 110%;\">10~30</span>分；</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 110%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">3</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">、结果评级</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; cm;margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-gd;mso-para-gd;text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 110%; layout-grid-mode: char; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">结合上述评价维度与加分项，累加计算参赛者的总分数。</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif; color: black; background: white; font-weight: normal;\"></span></span></p>",
